  649, 849, 35, 'plants/peace-lily.jpg',
  4.7, 356, 'White sail-like blooms in a room with barely any light.', 'One of the very few plants that flowers reliably indoors and in shade. It also tells you exactly when it is thirsty by drooping dramatically, then recovering within hours of a drink — which makes it unusually easy to read.', 'No flowers? It is almost always too dark. Move it nearer a window, not into the sun.',
