  649, 849, 30, 'plants/chinese-money-plant.jpg',
  4.8, 236, 'Perfectly round leaves on thin stems, and it makes you free plants.', 'The pancake plant. It throws up pups around its base constantly, which is why it spread across the world by being passed between friends rather than sold. Pet safe and genuinely easy.', 'Pups appearing at the base can be cut off with a bit of root and potted straight up.',
  'safe', 'Easy', 'medium', 'medium',
  'Low', 'Moderate', '25–40 cm',
  'Bright indirect light. Rotate it weekly or it leans hard toward the window.', 'Weekly, once the top 3 cm is dry. The leaves droop when thirsty and recover in hours.', 'Light, well-draining potting mix with perlite.', 'Ordinary room humidity is fine.',
  '16–26 °C.', 'Balanced feed monthly in spring and summer.', 'Annually; pot up the offsets at the same time.',
  TRUE, FALSE
