  1149, 1449, 30, 'plants/alocasia.jpg',
  4.4, 118, 'Arrow-shaped leaves with white veins. Dramatic, and it has demands.', 'The African Mask plant. Every leaf looks engineered — deep green, sharply veined, held on a dark stem. It wants humidity and warmth, and it will go dormant and drop everything if it gets cold.', 'If it drops every leaf in winter it is dormant, not dead. Keep the tuber barely moist and wait.',
