  'Low', 'Moderate', '50–90 cm',
  'Bright indirect light, never direct sun.', 'Every 5–7 days. Evenly moist, never soggy — it rots easily.', 'Chunky aroid mix with bark and perlite.', 'High, above 60%. This is the one it will not forgive.',
  '18–28 °C. Below 15 °C it goes dormant.', 'Balanced feed fortnightly in growth.', 'Every 2 years; it flowers rarely and does not mind being snug.',
  FALSE, FALSE
